    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-query hard limits used to prune expensive layered retrieval work. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Guardrails are disabled when <ref refid="structthemis_1_1search_1_1_per_query_retrieval_guardrails_1a31e030f7dbc595f6a1dab6541f8c71f9" kindref="member">enabled</ref> is false. When enabled, the orchestrator clamps ANN fan-out, provenance depth, and prompt size before a downstream layer is executed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
